msgid "Non adiabatic coupling matrix elements"
msgstr "非绝热耦合矩阵元"

msgid ""
"Non-adiabatic coupling matrix elements can be computed by finite differences"
" for ``MCSCF`` or ``CI`` wavefunctions using the ``DDR`` program. For state-"
"averaged ``MCSCF`` wavefunctions, they can also be computed analytically "
"(cf. section `difference gradients for SA-MCSCF "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#difference-gradients-for-sa-mcscf>`__)."
msgstr ""
"对于\\ ``MCSCF``\\ 或\\ ``CI``\\ 波函数，可以使用\\ ``DDR``\\ "
"程序通过有限差分计算非绝热耦合矩阵元。对于态平均\\ ``MCSCF``\\ 波函数，也可以解析计算（参见\\ `SA-MCSCF的差分梯度 "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#difference-gradients-for-sa-mcscf>`__\\ 一节）。"

msgid ""
"Note that present numerical procedure has been much simplified relative to "
"``Molpro96``. No ``GEOM`` and ``DISPL`` input cards are needed any more, and"
" the three necessary calculations can be done in any order."
msgstr ""
"请注意，当前的数值过程相对于\\ ``Molpro96``\\ 已大大简化。不再需要\\ ``GEOM``\\ 和\\ ``DISPL``\\ "
"输入卡，并且三个必要的计算可以按任意顺序进行。"

msgid "The DDR procedure"
msgstr "DDR过程"

msgid ""
"In order to compute the coupling matrix elements by finite differences, one "
"has to compute and store the wavefunctions at two (first-order algorithm) or"
" three (second-order algorithm) slightly displaced geometries. The order of "
"these calculations is arbitrary."
msgstr "为了通过有限差分计算耦合矩阵元，必须在两个（一阶算法）或三个（二阶算法）轻微位移的几何结构处计算并存储波函数。这些计算的顺序是任意的。"

msgid "The typical strategy is as follows:"
msgstr "典型策略如下："

msgid ""
"1.) Compute the wavefunction at the reference geometry. The wavefunctions "
"for both states have to be stored using the ``SAVE`` command of the ``CI`` "
"program. If the matrix elements are computed for ``MCSCF`` wavefunctions, it"
" is necessary to recompute the wavefunction with the ``CI`` program, using "
"the ``NOEXC`` option. The transition density matrix is stored using the "
"``DM`` directive of the CI program."
msgstr ""
"1.) 在参考几何结构处计算波函数。两个态的波函数必须使用\\ ``CI``\\ 程序的\\ ``SAVE``\\ 命令存储。如果为\\ "
"``MCSCF``\\ 波函数计算矩阵元，则需要使用\\ ``NOEXC``\\ 选项，通过\\ ``CI``\\ "
"程序重新计算波函数。跃迁密度矩阵使用CI程序的\\ ``DM``\\ 指令存储。"

msgid ""
"2.) Compute the wavefunctions at the (positively) displaced geometry and "
"store the CI wavefunction in a second record."
msgstr "2.) 在（正向）位移几何结构处计算波函数，并将CI波函数存储在第二个记录中。"

msgid ""
"3.) If the second-order (three-point) method is used, step (2) is repeated "
"at a (negatively) displaced geometry."
msgstr "3.) 如果使用二阶（三点）方法，则在（负向）位移几何结构处重复步骤（2）。"

msgid ""
"4.) Compute the transition density matrices between the states at the "
"reference geometry and the displaced geometr(ies). This is done with the "
"``TRANS`` directive of the CI program."
msgstr "4.) 计算参考几何结构与位移几何结构（们）之间的跃迁密度矩阵。这通过 CI 程序的 ``TRANS`` 指令完成。"

msgid ""
"5.) Finally, the ``DDR`` program is used to assemble the matrix element. "
"Using the first-order two-point method, only a single input line is needed:"
msgstr "5.) 最后，使用 ``DDR`` 程序组装矩阵元。使用一阶两点法时，仅需单行输入："

msgid ""
"where *dr* is the geometry increment used as denominator in the finite "
"difference method, *orb1* is the record holding the orbitals of the "
"reference geometry, *orb2* is the record holding the orbitals of the "
"displaced geometry, and *trdm2* is the record holding the transition density"
" matrix computed from the CI-vectors at *R* and *R+DR*."
msgstr ""
"其中 *dr* 是有限差分法中用作分母的几何结构增量，\\ *orb1* 是保存参考几何结构轨道的记录，\\ *orb2* "
"是保存位移几何结构轨道的记录，\\ *trdm2* 是保存由 *R* 和 *R+DR* 处 CI 向量计算得到的跃迁密度矩阵的记录。"

msgid ""
"If central differences (three points) are used, the input is as follows:"
msgstr "如果使用中心差分（三点法），输入如下："

msgid ""
"*trdm1, trdm2, trdm3* are the records holding the transition densities "
":math:`\\gamma(R|R)`, :math:`\\gamma(R|R+DR)`, and :math:`\\gamma(R|R-DR)`, "
"respectively."
msgstr ""
"*trdm1, trdm2, trdm3* 分别是保存跃迁密度 :math:`\\gamma(R|R)`\\ 、\\ "
":math:`\\gamma(R|R+DR)` 和 :math:`\\gamma(R|R-DR)` 的记录。"

msgid ""
"If more than two states are computed simultaneously, the transition density "
"matrices for all pairs of states will be stored in the same record. In that "
"case, and also when there are just two states whose spatial symmetry is not "
"1, it is necessary to specify for which states the coupling is to be "
"computed using the ``STATE`` directive:"
msgstr ""
"如果同时计算两个以上的态，所有态对之间的跃迁密度矩阵将存储在同一个记录中。在这种情况下，以及当只有两个态且其空间对称性不为 1 时，需要使用 "
"``STATE`` 指令指定要计算哪些态之间的耦合："

msgid ""
"As an example the input for first-order and second-order calculations is "
"given below. The calculation is repeated for a range of geometries, and at "
"the end of the calculation the results are printed using the ``TABLE`` "
"command."
msgstr "下面给出了一个一阶和二阶计算的输入示例。该计算在一系列几何结构下重复进行，并在计算结束时使用 ``TABLE`` 命令打印结果。"

msgid "This calculation produces the following table:"
msgstr "此计算生成以下表格："

msgid ""
"Note that the sign changes because of a phase change of one of the "
"wavefunctions. In order to keep track of the sign, one has to inspect both "
"the orbitals and the ci-vectors."
msgstr "请注意，由于其中一个波函数的相位变化，符号会发生改变。为了跟踪符号，必须同时检查轨道和CI向量。"

msgid ""
"Please also see `the_mcscf_program_multi#diabatic_orbitals "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#diabatic-orbitals>`__."
msgstr ""
"另请参阅 `the_mcscf_program_multi#diabatic_orbitals "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#diabaticorbitals>`__\\ 。"

msgid "``DDR, dr, orb1, orb2, trdm2``"
msgstr "``DDR, dr, orb1, orb2, trdm2``"

msgid ""
"``DDR,2*dr\\\\`` ``ORBITAL,orb1,orb2,orb3\\\\`` "
"``DENSITY,trdm1,trdm2,trdm3\\\\`` where *dr, orb1, orb2* are as above, and "
"*orb3* is the record holding the orbitals at the negatively displaced "
"geometry."
msgstr ""
"``DDR,2*dr\\\\`` ``ORBITAL,orb1,orb2,orb3\\\\`` "
"``DENSITY,trdm1,trdm2,trdm3\\\\``\\ ，其中 *dr, orb1, orb2* 如上所述，\\ *orb3* "
"是保存负向位移几何结构处轨道的记录。"

msgid "``STATE,state$_1$, state$_2$``"
msgstr "``STATE,state$_1$, state$_2$``"

msgid ""
"where *state:math:`_i`* is of the form *istate.isym* (the symmetries of both"
" states must be the same, and it is therefore sufficient to specify the "
"symmetry of the first state)."
msgstr "其中 *state:math:`_i`* 的形式为 *istate.isym*\\ （两个态的对称性必须相同，因此只需指定第一个态的对称性）。"

msgid ""
"In the calculation shown, the \"diabatic\" CASSCF orbitals are generated in "
"the two CASSCF calculations at the displaced geometries by maximizing the "
"overlap with the orbitals at the reference geometry. This is optional, and "
"(within the numerical accuracy) does not influence the final results. "
"However, the relative contributions of the orbital, overlap and CI "
"contributions to the NACME are modified. If diabatic orbitals are used, "
"which change as little as possible as function of geometry, the sum of "
"overlap and orbital contribution is minimized, and to a very good "
"approximation the NACME could be obtained from the CI-vectors alone."
msgstr ""
"在所示计算中，通过在两次位移几何结构处的 CASSCF 计算中最大化与参考几何结构处轨道的重叠，生成了“绝热”CASSCF "
"轨道。这是可选的，并且（在数值精度范围内）不影响最终结果。然而，轨道、重叠和 CI 对 NACME "
"的相对贡献会发生改变。如果使用随几何结构变化尽可能小的绝热轨道，则重叠与轨道贡献之和被最小化，并且在很好的近似下，NACME 可以仅由 CI 矢量获得。"

msgid "examples/lif_nacme.inp"
msgstr "examples/lif_nacme.inp"
